-- 3) deployment_type inferred as ONSITE when TerminalAddress contains CIMBN/KCP/KAS MOBIL/GRAHA CIMB, otherwise OFFSITE
-- 4) operation_hours defaults from deployment_type: ONSITE -> BUSINESS_HOURS, OFFSITE -> 24_HOURS
-- 5) capacity_amount, low_threshold_amount, critical_threshold_amount are left NULL because ESQ source does not provide reliable values
